    "\n",
    "::: {.lede}\n",
    "$F_{t+1} = \\alpha x_t + (1-\\alpha)F_t$ looks like it only remembers one step back. Unfold it and every observation you have ever seen is in there — each one weighted a little less than the one after it.\n",
    ":::\n",
    "\n",
    "## The memory hidden in one line {.stage-slide #smooth-intuition}\n",
    "\n",
    "::: {.stage-wrap .stage-wrap-std}\n",
