    "[]{.fragment .fi-frag id=\"smooth-frag-1\"}\n",
    "[]{.fragment .fi-frag id=\"smooth-frag-2\"}\n",
    "\n",
    "::: {.slide-footer}\n",
    "At $\\alpha = 0.8$ the forecast is barely a forecast — it is last month's number with a delay. At $\\alpha = 0.2$ it is so smooth it cannot turn a corner. Choosing $\\alpha$ is choosing where on that line to stand.\n",
    ":::\n",
